            {
                "h": "Terminal and flights",
                "p": [
                    "Work to extend the runway, taxiways and apron was completed in March 2025, and scheduled services resumed after a technical flight on 15 March. On 3 July 2026 the airport received its first wide-body passenger flight, a flyadeal Airbus A330 from Medina. The contract to build a new passenger terminal was signed on 5 February 2026.",
                    "On the board for 20–22 October 2026: Tashkent (Silk Avia) and Moscow (Vnukovo)."
